# Documentation sync

| File | Scope |
|------|--------|
| `README.md` | App overview, architecture, setup, routes, scripts, matching summary |
| `docs/DATABASE.md` | Supabase tables, jsonb shapes, path mappings, query patterns, backend-only table reference |

When you change code, update the relevant doc(s) in the **same change**. Do not leave docs stale.

## Must update `docs/DATABASE.md` when you change

| Area | Sections to check |
|------|-------------------|
| `src/lib/types/community.ts` | `profile` and `feature_scores` jsonb, TypeScript mirrors |
| `src/lib/community-select.ts` | Query pattern, columns fetched |
| `src/lib/website-content.ts` | Profile path → UI field tables |
| `src/lib/feature-scores.ts` | Legacy migration behavior |

## Must update `README.md` when you change

| Area | Sections to check |
|------|-------------------|
| `src/lib/discovery-profile.ts` | Discovery chat, profile titles |
| `src/lib/matching/feature-keys.ts`, `alignment.ts`, `weights.ts` | Matching summary |
| `src/app/api/**` | API routes |
| New/edited `src/app/**` routes | Features, project layout |
| `package.json` scripts | Scripts table |
| Env vars in code | Setup / `.env.local` |
| `scripts/discover-communities.mjs` | Scripts table |

Schema-only changes: update `docs/DATABASE.md` (and types); touch `README.md` only if the data-model summary table or doc links need updating.

## Backend (agent system) changes

Supabase/jsonb changes from [monastery-finder-agent-system](https://github.com/meredithvf/monastery-finder-agent-system) that this app reads: update `docs/DATABASE.md` and `src/lib/types/community.ts`. Document new tables in DATABASE.md when this app starts querying them.

## Style

Keep prose concise; prefer tables for schemas. App title: **Monastery** Finder.
